---
import Section from '../Section.astro';

const interventions = [
  'data pipelines',
  'integrations',
  'workflow automation',
  'reporting and decision systems',
  'operational applications',
  'bounded AI systems',
  'existing software where it is the better answer',
];
---

<Section variant="texture-1" id="how-we-work" label="How We Work">
  <h2 class="text-h2 mb-md">Operational systems that grow with you.</h2>
  <p class="text-muted max-w-2xl mb-lg">
    Guava starts with how the business actually operates. We connect the
    relevant data, workflows, systems, constraints, and decision points, then
    build the simplest system that meaningfully improves the operation.
  </p>
  <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-text mb-sm">Possible interventions may include:</p>
  <ul class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-x-lg gap-y-sm max-w-2xl list-none p-0">
    {interventions.map((item) => (
      <li class="flex items-start gap-sm">
        <span aria-hidden="true" class="mt-1 h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-brand"></span>
        <span class="text-body text-muted">{item}</span>
      </li>
    ))}
  </ul>
</Section>